  "factor_name": "DXY-confirmed breadth flip volatility-normalized relative strength",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "base = rolling_mean_10((close[t-1]/close[t-21]-1)/vol20[t-1] - cross_sectional_median); signal = -base when mean5(breadth20[t-1]) < 0.40 and DXY[t-1]/DXY[t-11]-1 > 0, else base",
    "description": "A lag-safe volatility-normalized 20-session relative-strength signal, cross-sectionally median centered and smoothed over 10 sessions. It flips direction only when lagged breadth is weak and the lagged 10-session DXY return is positive, identifying dollar-confirmed stress/reversal conditions."
